ct word. </span>\n<span class=\"bullet\">Type in the correct word to complete the sentence.</span>\n"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob06re6aud01"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"type": "template_override", "content": 2}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Many people believe systems theory is only for software "}], "type": "question"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "so"}], "type": "incorrect"}, {"contents": {"type": "", "content": "computing,"}, "type": "post_question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "and"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 1}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "and"}], "type": "incorrect"}, {"contents": {"type": "", "content": "it works at different levels. We know that when the model of electrical circuits appeared, software and computing apeeared too."}, "type": "post_question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "but"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 1}], "id": 1}, {"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "  Actually, systems are for mathematics "}], "type": "question"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "so"}], "type": "incorrect"}, {"contents": {"type": "", "content": "human sciences too because there are systems in all areas."}, "type": "post_question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "and"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 1}], "id": 2}], "type": "GIW", "template_override": 2, "id": 10}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1, "id": 11}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Make a brochure about system theory history."}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "enpe8n1le01ob06re7pdf01.pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1, "id": 12}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome"}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n1le01ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "100", "image": "enpe8n1le01ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mary</span>: Carol, I need your help!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carol</span>: How can I help you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mary</span>: Well, I want to know a little bit about systems theory in information systems. I'm sure you know a lot about that.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carol</span>: Well, we need to understand two aspects first. <br>One of them is functional, where we record, store, and distribute algorithmic expressions, and the other one is structural, where we assess people, processes, data, models, and language to design a structure with a purpose or function for an organization.<br>"}, {"time": "30000", "image": "enpe8n1le01ob06re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mary</span>: That's new to me! Can you tell me about the purpose of systems theory?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carol</span>: Sure! The main purpose is to make good decisions and to maintain control of an organization or of a company. It helps workers and managers analyze problems and create new products.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mary</span>: It sounds interesting. What implications does systems theory have for a company?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carol</span>: It's important for all companies. To understand that, we need to talk about input, processing, and output. Input is about data capture, processing is about data applications, and output is about the transference of the results that the applications show to the managers who make decisions based on this information. Feedback is next. <br>"}, {"time": "75000", "image": "enpe8n1le01ob06re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mary</span>: I have another question. What do you know about the history of systems theory?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carol</span>: Well, the Society for General Systems Research, born in 1956, studies all phenomena in any system and identifies common patterns in a variety of systems in search of a unified theory.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mary</span>: I understand everything, but the history of systems theory in software and computing development is not clear to me.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carol</span>: Well, when the model of electrical circuits and other systems appeared, the new software applications and computing programs originated too. All of these developments demonstrate practical applications of systems theory.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mary</span>: You're very kind, Carol. Lunch is on me!"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n1le01ob06re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "title": ""}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"video_src": "enpe8n1le01ob06re5vsc01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "", "id": 0, "text": ""}]}, "type": "video"}], "type": "video", "template_override": 1, "id": 4, "title": ""}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar"}]}